WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.440
Late at night, in a
lamplit castle library,

2
00:00:03.490 --> 00:00:07.240
a cloaked figure lies on
a sofa, turning the pages.

3
00:00:07.290 --> 00:00:11.940
The book is an English Bradshaw's
Guide: railway timetables.

4
00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:15.110
Beside it lie English
law, English history,

5
00:00:15.160 --> 00:00:16.760
a London directory.

6
00:00:16.810 --> 00:00:21.040
He tells his English guest: "But
a stranger in a strange land,

7
00:00:21.090 --> 00:00:22.480
