8
00:00:22.530 --> 00:00:28.400
Then a line of stops lights up:
castle, Varna, Whitby, London.

9
00:00:28.450 --> 00:00:30.800
Small boxes travel along it.

10
00:00:30.850 --> 00:00:35.480
So why would a vampire spend his
evenings reading train timetables?

11
00:00:35.530 --> 00:00:40.160
In this mission, you'll meet the 1890s,
and its bestselling stories of Britain

12
00:00:40.210 --> 00:00:41.290
invaded.

13
00:00:41.340 --> 00:00:44.620
You'll hear what he longs
for in "your mighty London",

14
00:00:44.670 --> 00:00:47.150
and track fifty boxes of earth.

15
00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:50.940
Your mission: explain why
he studies the timetables.
